    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch16-11> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch16-11--grok--data-adequacy> .
